ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">London is no longer a city of fog.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奇怪；怪异；古怪；奇妙；奇迹；神奇；卓越；妙处；聪慧；灵巧；巧妙；技巧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103194\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>生徒<rp>(</rp><rt>せいと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>妙<rp>(</rp><rt>みょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をえている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He is skillful in teaching pupils.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">明後日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みょうごにち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后天；错误的；不对的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234491\">あさって<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にここへ<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てもらうつもりです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I will have him come here the day after tomorrow.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">未来</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">みらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（遥远的）未来；来世；彼岸；将来时态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233007\">あなたの<ruby>未来<rp>(</rp><rt>みらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>乾杯